@startuml
title EcoRefill — Activity diagram
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EAF7F1
skinparam activityBorderColor #23765C
skinparam ArrowColor #425B54
start
:Customer approaches EcoRefill;
if (Choose service) then (Recycle)
  repeat
    :Insert one bottle or can;
    :Capture image; identify material;
    :Check detection thresholds, stable weight <= 300 g,
    and any enforced visual inspection;
    if (Item accepted?) then (Yes)
      :Send sorting command; record accepted item;
      :Add 1 EcoPoint to the machine session;
    else (No)
      :Reject item; record reason; award no points;
    endif
  repeat while (Insert another item?) is (Yes) not (No)
  :Press green button;
  if (Session has accepted items?) then (Yes)
    :Save batch reward; display reward QR;
    :Sign in or register in app; scan reward QR;
    if (Authenticated claim and valid, unclaimed,
    unexpired reward?) then (Yes)
      :Credit customer points; mark reward claimed;
      :Record reward transaction;
    else (No)
      :Show claim error; no points credited;
    endif
  else (No)
    :Show no-reward message;
  endif
else (Refill water)
  :Press blue button or select Refill Water;
  :Pause recycling; create refill session;
  :Display refill QR;
  :Sign in or register in app; scan refill QR;
  :Select 250, 500, or 1,000 mL;
  if (Choose optional Buy Points?) then (Yes)
    :Check owner accepts GCash and has enough points;
    if (Purchase available?) then (Yes)
      :Create purchase; customer pays owner in GCash;
      :Submit sender name and receipt reference;
      :Owner manually checks received payment;
      if (Owner approves and transfer checks pass?) then (Yes)
        :Atomically transfer owner points to customer;
        :Record approved purchase transaction;
      else (No)
        :Show rejected or pending status;
        :Do not transfer points;
      endif
    else (No)
      :Show purchase unavailable;
    endif
    :Return to refill; scan a new QR if expired;
  endif
  :Place container; confirm refill;
  :Validate customer, session, machine,
  selected amount, and point balance;
  if (Request valid and enough points?) then (Yes)
    :Atomically deduct customer points,
    reserve session, and record transaction;
    :Send dispensing command to ESP32;
    if (Dispensing completes?) then (Yes)
      :Mark refill completed and credit machine owner;
    else (Error / timeout)
      :Attempt point refund and record failed refill;
    endif
    :Return machine to recycling mode;
  else (No)
    :Show validation error; do not dispense;
  endif
endif
:Customer finishes or starts another service;
stop
legend bottom
  Reward QR validity: 60 seconds. Waiting refill QR validity: 5 minutes.
  Recycling requires no app login; claiming points and requesting refills do.
  Purchase review is asynchronous. Pending purchases can be checked later.
  Rejected payment requests do not automatically refund GCash.
  Persistence steps show the normal online path; see SYSTEM_DIAGRAMS.md for limits.
endlegend
@enduml
